      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='1001' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='100000' id='1002' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <zone fixed-size='64' forceUpdate='true' h='11429' id='1003' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98667' x='667' y='1429'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#1f1f1f' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='17'>Penalized hospitals rate lower with patients but have similar death rates</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='10'>Hospitals grouped by their FY2026 readmission penalty and compared with CMS quality data  ·  CMS data, fiscal year 2026  ·  Rodrigo Bravo</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='padding' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='280' h='50000' id='1004' is-fixed='true' layout-strategy-id='distribute-evenly' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98667' x='667' y='12857'>
              <zone h='50000' id='1005' name='Quality patient ratings' w='49333' x='667' y='12857'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='padding' value='8' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='50000' id='1006' name='Quality death rates' w='49333' x='50000' y='12857'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='padding' value='8' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='100' forceUpdate='true' h='17857' id='1007' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98667' x='667' y='62857'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#1f1f1f' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>What this shows</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#3c4043' fontsize='10'>The bigger the penalty, the fewer hospitals with 4–5 star patient ratings (53% with no penalty, 29% under 1%, 20% at 1% or more), while death rates were about the same (3.9–4.0%). Penalties line up with how patients rate their care, not with how many patients die. This compares hospitals; it doesn&apos;t show that one causes the other.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='padding' value='12' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='100' forceUpdate='true' h='17857' id='1008' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98667' x='667' y='80714'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Data</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>: Medicare&apos;s FY2026 readmission penalties; CMS patient survey (HCAHPS) summary star rating, Oct 2024–Sep 2025 (2,639 hospitals rated); CMS hospital-wide death rate within 30 days of admission, adjusted for how sick patients are, Jul 2024–Jun 2025 (2,873 hospitals). CMS&apos;s overall star rating isn&apos;t used because it already counts readmissions.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f3f4f6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{4A41F8E4-D4D6-5278-889B-5123E842997D}' />
